      "name": "_SmackBufferStartMultipleBlits@4",
      "signature": "void _SmackBufferStartMultipleBlits@4(void * pSmackBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes a SmackBuffer for multiple blit operations.\n\nAllocates the blit context array if not already present, then sets up\nthe buffer state for accumulating blit rectangles. Each blit context\nis 24 bytes (0x18), and the maximum count is stored at offset 0x4b0.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if blit array pointer at offset 0x4a8 is already allocated\n2. If NULL, allocate (maxBlits * 24) bytes via radmalloc\n3. Store allocated pointer at offset 0x4a8\n4. If allocation failed, return early (no error indication)\n5. Set blit mode to 2 at offset 0x4a4 (multiple blit mode)\n6. Reset current blit count to 0 at offset 0x4b4\n7. Set current blit pointer to array start at offset 0x4ac\n\nParameters:\n  pSmackBuffer - Pointer to SmackBuffer structure (extended, ~1200+ bytes)\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value; allocation failure causes silent early return\n\nStructure Layout (SmackBuffer blit-related fields):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Description\n  0x4a4   4     dwBlitMode         Blit mode (2 = multiple blits active)\n  0x4a8   4     pBlitContextArray  Pointer to allocated blit context array\n  0x4ac   4     pCurrentBlit       Current position in blit array\n  0x4b0   4     dwMaxBlits         Maximum number of blit contexts\n  0x4b4   4     dwBlitCount        Current number of queued blits\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x18 (24) - Size of each blit context structure\n  2 - Blit mode flag indicating multiple blits are being accumulated",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:7886df2cbc50e9713e0c6ef96963e7bb8495d29232e65a49775883206a15f5cf",
