      "name": "_SmackOpen@12",
      "signature": "int * _SmackOpen@12(int * pFileOrHandle, uint dwOpenFlags, uint dwExtraFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int *",
      "comment": "Opens a Smacker video file and initializes the Smack playback structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pFileOrHandle is non-null, return NULL if invalid\n2. Initialize debug logging from registry (RadVideo section)\n3. If SMACKFILEHANDLE flag set (0x1000), treat pFileOrHandle as file handle\n   - If SMACKFROMMEMORY flag set (0x2000000), dereference to get actual handle\n   - Get current file position via SetFilePointer\n4. Otherwise open file by name using CreateFileA with read access\n5. Allocate 0x510 byte Smack structure via radmalloc\n6. Zero-initialize structure (0x144 DWORDs)\n7. Read 0x68 byte Smack file header via ReadSmackFrame\n8. Validate signature matches SMK2 (0x324B4D53)\n9. Apply default frame rate if SMACKFRAMERATE flag (0x80) set\n10. Calculate frame timing based on usPerFrame field\n11. Allocate frame index table (5 bytes per frame)\n12. Read frame sizes and compute largest/total sizes\n13. Allocate decompression buffer based on largest frame\n14. Initialize Huffman tables via DecompressSmackFrame\n15. If SMACKLOADEXTRA flag (0x200) set or small buffer needed, load all frames\n16. Otherwise allocate streaming read buffer\n17. Initialize audio tracks if SMACKAUDIO flags (0xFE000) set\n18. Apply interlace mode based on flags\n19. Record open timing for profiling\n\nParameters:\npFileOrHandle - Either filename string or file HANDLE depending on flags\ndwOpenFlags - Bit flags controlling open behavior:\n  0x00000010 - SMACKFILEHANDLE: pFileOrHandle is file handle not filename\n  0x00000080 - SMACKFRAMERATE: Use g_nDefaultFrameRate\n  0x00000100 - SMACKPRELOADALL: Preload all frames\n  0x00000200 - SMACKLOADEXTRA: Force load to buffer\n  0x00000800 - SMACKAUDIOTRACK0: Enable audio track 0\n  0x00100000 - SMACKINTERLACE1: Interlace mode 1\n  0x00200000 - SMACKINTERLACE2: Interlace mode 2\n  0x00300000 - SMACKINTERLACEBOTH: Both interlace modes\n  0x02000000 - SMACKFROMMEMORY: pFileOrHandle points to handle\ndwExtraFlags - Audio buffer size hint (-1 for auto-detect)\n\nReturns:\nPointer to initialized Smack structure on success\nNULL on failure (invalid input, file not found, allocation failure, bad signature)\n\nError Handling:\nOutputs debug strings via OutputDebugStringA when g_bDebugAudio is 1\nFrees partially allocated resources on failure path",
