      "name": "_SmackFrameRate@4",
      "signature": "void _SmackFrameRate@4(int nFramesPerSecond)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets the default frame rate for Smacker video playback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nFramesPerSecond is positive (valid FPS value)\n2. If positive: Calculate frame interval as -100000 / nFramesPerSecond\n   - The negative value represents microseconds-per-frame for timing\n3. If zero or negative: Store value directly as raw timing interval\n4. Store result in g_nDefaultFrameRate global\n\nParameters:\n  nFramesPerSecond (int) - Target frames per second for playback.\n    - Positive values: Interpreted as FPS, converted to timing interval\n    - Zero or negative: Used directly as raw timing value\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0xFFFE7960 (-100000) - Microsecond conversion factor for frame timing\n\nRelated Functions:\n  _SmackOpen@12 - Reads g_nDefaultFrameRate to set initial playback rate",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:d53e86bfc7d7144e0928770442c9ab4c37104942ef609e8e83030364b90a20b3",
