      "name": "_SmackSummary@8",
      "signature": "void _SmackSummary@8(int pSmack, int * pnSummary)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Populates a summary structure with Smack video playback statistics.\n\nGathers timing data, frame counts, and performance metrics from the Smack\nstructure and writes them into the output summary array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Accumulate frame timing statistics via AccumulateFrameTimingStats\n2. Get current time and calculate elapsed playback time\n3. Copy frame counts, timing stats, and buffer sizes to summary array\n4. Calculate average frame rate (frames per 1000ms) if total time > 0\n5. Copy audio timing and synchronization data\n6. Retrieve current audio track information if available\n\nParameters:\n  pSmack - Pointer to Smack video structure containing playback state\n  pnSummary - Output array receiving 19 summary statistics values\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSummary Array Layout (indices):\n  [0]  Elapsed time since playback start (ms)\n  [1]  Total frames decoded\n  [2]  Video decode time (ms)\n  [3]  Blit/render time (ms)\n  [4]  Read time (ms)\n  [5]  Current audio track sample offset\n  [6]  Audio decode time (ms)\n  [7]  Frames behind schedule\n  [8]  Frame skip count\n  [9]  Audio buffer fill time\n  [10] Average frame rate (frames per 1000ms)\n  [11] Audio rate or default 1000\n  [12] Video rate or default 1000\n  [13] Audio frames decoded + 1\n  [14] Video frames decoded + 1\n  [15] Audio buffer underruns\n  [16] Video buffer underruns\n  [17] Highest frame memory usage\n  [18] Audio buffer high watermark",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
