      "name": "BuildVertexTransformMatrix",
      "signature": "void BuildVertexTransformMatrix(short * pnTransformBuffer, short nScaleX, uint dwScaleFactors, short nOffsetY, short nOffsetX, short nShearY)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Builds a 5-element transformation matrix for vertex coordinate scaling and shearing.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Store primary scale factor (nScaleX) in element[0]\n  2. Calculate normalized scale divisor (dwScaleFactors >> 2) for element[1]\n  3. Compute sheared Y offset (nOffsetY * nScaleX - 4 * nShearY) for element[2]\n  4. Compute linear Y offset (nOffsetY * nScaleX) for element[3]\n  5. Calculate skewed X offset with cross-term (nOffsetX * nScaleX - dwScaleFactors * nShearY) for element[4]\n\nParameters:\n  pnTransformBuffer - Pointer to short[5] output array for transformation values\n  nScaleX           - Primary scaling factor for X dimension\n  dwScaleFactors    - Bit-packed scale values (right-shifted by 2 for normalization)\n  nOffsetY          - Y-axis translation offset\n  nOffsetX          - X-axis translation offset\n  nShearY           - Shear/skew factor (applied with 4x multiplier)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Populates pnTransformBuffer[0..4] with transformation coefficients\n\nOutput Buffer Layout:\n  Offset  Element  Formula                              Purpose\n  0x00    [0]      nScaleX                              Primary scale factor\n  0x02    [1]      dwScaleFactors >> 2                  Normalized scale divisor\n  0x04    [2]      nOffsetY * nScaleX - 4 * nShearY     Sheared Y offset\n  0x06    [3]      nOffsetY * nScaleX                   Linear Y offset\n  0x08    [4]      nOffsetX * nScaleX - dwScaleFactors * nShearY  Cross-term X offset\n\nCalled By:\n  RenderSmackFrameToScreen - Sets up transformation for Smacker video frame rendering",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:f4f403aaeba0052e261babcb5abb2a9c53770a0059e1b42c032a27deda4cacdf",
