      "name": "SmackVolumePan",
      "signature": "void SmackVolumePan(int nSmackHandle, int nChannelMask, int nVolume, int nPan)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets volume and pan for active Smack audio channels.\n\nIterates through the channel mask, processing each set bit to apply volume\nand pan settings via the registered sound callback. Volume and pan values\nare clamped to 0x10000 (65536) maximum.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate nSmackHandle is non-null and has valid sound index (offset 0x444 != -1)\n2. Clamp volume to maximum 0x10000\n3. Clamp pan to maximum 0x10000\n4. Extract channel bits from mask (bits 13-19, mask 0xFE000)\n5. For each set channel bit:\n   a. Call FindFirstSetBitAndClear to get channel index (0-6)\n   b. Get sound handle from Smack structure at offset 0x428 + index*4\n   c. If handle valid and callback registered, invoke callback with volume/pan\n\nParameters:\n  nSmackHandle (int) - Pointer to Smack handle structure\n  nChannelMask (int) - Bitmask of channels to modify (bits 13-19 for channels 0-6)\n  nVolume (int) - Volume level (0 to 0x10000, clamped if higher)\n  nPan (int) - Pan position (0 to 0x10000, clamped if higher)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns immediately if nSmackHandle is NULL\n  - Returns if sound index at offset 0x444 is -1 (invalid)\n  - Skips channels with no sound handle\n  - Skips if g_pfnSmackSoundCallback is NULL\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x10000 - Maximum volume/pan value (65536)\n  0xFE000 - Channel mask filter (bits 13-19)\n  0x444 - Offset in Smack structure for sound validity index\n  0x428 - Offset in Smack structure for sound handle array base\n  7 - Maximum channel index (channels 0-6)\n\nStructure Layout (Smack sound-related offsets):\n  Offset  Size  Field           Description\n  0x428   4*7   paSoundHandles  Array of 7 sound handles for channels 0-6\n  0x444   4     nSoundIndex     Sound validity index (-1 = invalid)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:c9c8631796a0862a6e73fdad637e55c380b442601477b7c5c8a40c997ca1fd7e",
