      "name": "_SmackSoundUseDW@12",
      "signature": "uint _SmackSoundUseDW@12(uint dwSoundRate, uint dwSoundBits, uint dwSoundChannels)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Initializes DiamondWare Sound System (DWS) for Smack video audio playback.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if sound handler already initialized (g_pfnSmackSoundHandler != NULL)\n2. Call GetVersion() to detect Windows version\n3. Load DWSW32S.DLL (Win32s) or DWSW32.DLL (Win95/NT) via LoadLibraryA\n4. Validate module handle (must be >= 0x20, else fail)\n5. Resolve 11 DWS function pointers via GetProcAddress:\n   - dws_ErrNo, dws_DGetInfo, dws_DPlay, dws_DDiscard\n   - dws_DPause, dws_DUnPause, dws_XDig, dws_DetectHardWare\n   - dws_Init, dws_Kill, dws_DClear\n6. Validate all function pointers resolved (non-NULL)\n7. Store sound parameters in globals\n8. Calculate buffer size: (dwSoundBits >> 3) * dwSoundChannels * dwSoundRate\n9. Set up Smack sound handler function pointers\n\nParameters:\n  dwSoundRate - Audio sample rate in Hz (e.g., 22050, 44100)\n  dwSoundBits - Bits per sample (8 or 16)\n  dwSoundChannels - Number of audio channels (1=mono, 2=stereo)\n\nReturns:\n  1 (TRUE) - DWS initialized successfully, all function pointers resolved\n  0 (FALSE) - Initialization failed:\n    - Already initialized\n    - LoadLibraryA failed (handle < 0x20)\n    - GetProcAddress failed for any DWS function\n\nGlobal Variables Modified:\n  g_hDwsModule - DWS DLL module handle\n  g_pfnDwsErrNo, g_pfnDwsDGetInfo, etc. - DWS function pointers\n  g_dwSoundRate, g_dwSoundBits, g_dwSoundChannels - Sound configuration\n  g_dwSoundBufferSize - Calculated buffer size in bytes\n  g_pfnSmackSoundHandler - Main sound handler callback\n  g_pfnSmackSoundInit/Open/Close/Mix - Smack sound interface functions",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
