      "name": "AcquireAudioLock",
      "signature": "void AcquireAudioLock(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Acquires exclusive audio manager lock and invokes pre-lock callback\n\nAlgorithm\n  1. Check if audio system initialized via g_bAudioInitialized flag\n  2. Check if audio manager pointer g_pAudioManager is not NULL\n  3. Atomically increment global lock counter g_dwAudioLockCount\n  4. Invoke pre-lock callback g_pfnAudioPreLock if registered\n  5. Call audio manager virtual method at offset 0x8 from manager vtable\n  6. Atomically decrement global lock counter g_dwAudioLockCount\n  7. Invoke post-lock callback g_pfnAudioPostLock if registered\n  8. Clear audio manager pointer by setting g_pAudioManager to NULL\n  9. Return to caller\n\nParameters\n  None\n\nReturns\n  void (no return value)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:5f3fa709e6f3200d81cdfb5bd64b2400d77acd013b063cad7b2004bb458a94b6",
