      "comment": "Sets blitting flags on a SmackBlitContext and updates its palette/frame configuration.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate scaling flags (0xC0000000) - require non-null scale table (offset 0x10)\n2. Validate transparency flag (0x4) - require non-null transparency table (offset 0xC)\n3. Compute scale index from flags via GetBlitScaleIndex\n4. Store scale index at offset 0x14 and flags at offset 0x0\n5. Call UpdateBlitContextPaletteAndFrame to apply changes\n\nParameters:\n  pBlitContext - Pointer to SmackBlitContext structure to modify\n  dwFlags      - Blit flags to set (scaling, transparency, etc.)\n\nReturns:\n  0 - Failure: required lookup table missing for requested flag\n  1 - Success: flags set and context updated\n\nFlag Bits:\n  0xC0000000 - Scaling flags (require scale table at offset 0x10)\n  0x00000004 - Transparency flag (require transparency table at offset 0xC)\n\nStructure Layout (SmackBlitContext):\n  Offset  Size  Field          Description\n  0x00    4     dwFlags        Current blit flags\n  0x0C    4     pTransTable    Transparency lookup table pointer\n  0x10    4     pScaleTable    Scaling lookup table pointer\n  0x14    4     dwScaleIndex   Computed scale index from flags",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:2dacdf4d1daa2cf8888eb0705ee8e2dd84889daa731244e5842a08a98836290e",
