      "name": "_SmackBlitMask@52",
      "signature": "void _SmackBlitMask@52(int pSmackBlit, byte * pbDstBuffer, int nDstPitch, int nDstX, int nDstY, byte * pbSrcBuffer, int nSrcPitch, int nSrcX, int nSrcY, uint dwWidth, int nHeight, char cMaskValue, byte * pbMaskBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Blits a masked rectangular region from a source buffer to a destination buffer using SIMD operations.\n\nThis is an exported Smacker video library function that performs masked buffer copying with support \nfor arbitrary source and destination positions. The function validates input parameters before \ndelegating to BlitMaskedBufferSIMD for the actual copy operation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate that width (dwWidth) and height (nHeight) are non-zero\n2. Check that the SmackBlit structure's disable flag at offset 0x14 is not set\n3. Calculate source buffer offset: nSrcOffset = nSrcY * nSrcPitch + nSrcX\n4. Calculate destination buffer position: pbDstBuffer + nDstY * nDstPitch + nDstX\n5. Calculate adjusted pitches for both buffers (pitch - width)\n6. Call BlitMaskedBufferSIMD with computed addresses and dimensions\n\nParameters:\n- pSmackBlit: Pointer to SmackBlitContext structure (checked at offset 0x14 for disable flag)\n- pbDstBuffer: Pointer to destination buffer base address\n- nDstPitch: Destination buffer row stride in bytes\n- nDstX: Destination X coordinate (horizontal offset)\n- nDstY: Destination Y coordinate (vertical offset)\n- pbSrcBuffer: Pointer to source buffer base address\n- nSrcPitch: Source buffer row stride in bytes\n- nSrcX: Source X coordinate (horizontal offset)\n- nSrcY: Source Y coordinate (vertical offset)\n- dwWidth: Width of region to copy in pixels\n- nHeight: Height of region to copy in rows\n- cMaskValue: Transparency/mask byte value for masked copy\n- pbMaskBuffer: Pointer to mask buffer for transparency operations\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if dwWidth is 0\n- Returns immediately if nHeight is 0\n- Returns immediately if SmackBlitContext disable flag (offset 0x14) is non-zero",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:9818ea1521aa5b12fa0324755c0678bc1785caea068b2b2079043e30a24ff0da",
