      "name": "_SmackBufferToBuffer@32",
      "signature": "void _SmackBufferToBuffer@32(int * pDestBuffer, int nDestX, uint dwDestY, int * pSrcBuffer, int nSrcX, uint dwSrcY, uint dwWidth, int nHeight)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Copies a rectangular region from a source Smacker buffer to a destination buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate both buffer pointers are non-null\n2. Check destination buffer orientation flag at [0x00]\n3. If destination is flipped (flag != 0):\n   - Adjust Y coordinate: destY = destHeight - destY - height\n4. Check source buffer orientation flag at [0x00]\n5. If source is flipped (flag != 0):\n   - Adjust source Y and calculate negative pitch for reverse row traversal\n6. Calculate source and destination pixel addresses:\n   - pixelData = buffer[0x448] + (pitch * Y) + X\n7. Call CopyBitmapRegion with calculated addresses and pitches\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer - Pointer to destination SmackBuffer structure\n  nDestX      - X coordinate in destination buffer (pixels)\n  dwDestY     - Y coordinate in destination buffer (pixels)\n  pSrcBuffer  - Pointer to source SmackBuffer structure\n  nSrcX       - X coordinate in source buffer (pixels)\n  dwSrcY      - Y coordinate in source buffer (pixels)\n  dwWidth     - Width of region to copy (pixels)\n  nHeight     - Height of region to copy (pixels)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSmackBuffer Structure Layout (relevant fields):\n  Offset  Size  Field        Description\n  0x00    4     dwFlags      Orientation flag (0=normal, non-zero=flipped)\n  0x14    4     dwHeight     Buffer height in pixels\n  0x18    4     dwPitch      Bytes per row (stride)\n  0x448   4     pPixelData   Pointer to raw pixel data\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns immediately if either buffer pointer is null\n- Handles Y-flip for both source and destination independently\n- Negative pitch used for bottom-to-top row traversal when flipped",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
      "index": "NOP:4c3015666937dcd43d343eb9304c1c3543a2eae085bb449b591a9a649cb8e46b",
