      "name": "_SmackBufferToBufferMerge@40",
      "signature": "void _SmackBufferToBufferMerge@40(int * pDestBuffer, int nDestX, uint dwDestY, int * pSrcBuffer, int nSrcX, uint dwSrcY, uint dwWidth, int nHeight, char cColorKey, int * pOutBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Merges a rectangular region from source SmackBuffer to destination with color key transparency.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pDestBuffer and pSrcBuffer are non-null\n2. Verify pOutBuffer and pSrcBuffer have matching format (orientation flag at offset 0x0)\n3. Verify pOutBuffer and pSrcBuffer have matching stride (row bytes at offset 0x18)\n4. Calculate source/destination Y coordinates based on buffer orientations:\n   - If destination is top-down (flag=0) and source is top-down: stride = nStride - dwWidth\n   - If destination is top-down and source is bottom-up: flip Y, stride = -(dwWidth + nStride)\n   - If destination is bottom-up and source is top-down: flip destY, stride = -(dwWidth + nStride)\n   - If destination is bottom-up and source is bottom-up: stride = nStride - dwWidth\n5. Calculate pixel buffer offsets: nStride * dwSrcY + nSrcX\n6. Call BlitMergeWithColorKey to perform actual pixel copy with transparency\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer - Destination SmackBuffer structure (contains pixel buffer at offset 0x448)\n  nDestX - Destination X offset in pixels\n  dwDestY - Destination Y offset in pixels\n  pSrcBuffer - Source SmackBuffer to copy from\n  nSrcX - Source X offset in pixels  \n  dwSrcY - Source Y offset in pixels\n  dwWidth - Width of region to copy in pixels\n  nHeight - Height of region to copy in pixels\n  cColorKey - Transparent color index (pixels matching this are not copied)\n  pOutBuffer - Output SmackBuffer (must match pSrcBuffer format and stride)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns early if pDestBuffer or pSrcBuffer is NULL\n  - Returns early if pOutBuffer format != pSrcBuffer format\n  - Returns early if pOutBuffer stride != pSrcBuffer stride\n\nSSA Variables (decompiler-generated, cannot rename):\n  sVar1 (wHeight) - Short cast of nHeight for 16-bit arithmetic\n  iVar2 (nStride) - Row stride from pSrcBuffer[6] (offset 0x18)\n  iVar3 (nOrientation) - Buffer orientation flag from *pSrcBuffer (offset 0x0)\n\nSmackBuffer Structure Layout (partial):\n  Offset  Size  Field         Description\n  0x00    4     nFormat       Orientation flag (0=top-down, non-0=bottom-up)\n  0x14    4     nWidth        Buffer width in pixels\n  0x18    4     nStride       Row stride in bytes\n  0x448   4     pPixels       Pointer to actual pixel buffer",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
      "method": "NOP",
