      "name": "SetMultibyteCodePage",
      "signature": "int SetMultibyteCodePage(int nCodePage)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Sets the multibyte code page for CRT string functions and initializes the _mbctype table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Convert code page to LCID via getSystemCP helper\n2. If same as current code page, return success (0)\n3. If code page is 0, call setSBCS for single-byte mode and return success\n4. Search predefined code page table (0x100154c8 to 0x100155b8) for match\n5. If predefined found, use cached lead byte ranges from table\n6. If not predefined, call GetCPInfo to get lead byte ranges from OS\n7. If GetCPInfo fails, check g_fSbcsFallbackEnabled flag:\n   - If set, fall back to SBCS mode and return success\n   - If not set, return -1 (error)\n8. Clear 257-byte _mbctype table (g_abMbcType)\n9. For multibyte code pages (MaxCharSize > 1):\n   - Mark lead byte ranges with 0x04 (lead byte flag)\n   - Mark bytes 0x01-0xFE with 0x08 (valid character flag)\n10. Save code page to g_dwCurrentCodePage\n11. Get and save locale ID to g_dwLocaleId\n12. Copy code page info to g_stMbCodePageInfo structure\n\nParameters:\n  nCodePage - Windows code page identifier (e.g., 932 for Japanese Shift-JIS,\n              936 for Simplified Chinese GBK, 0 for system default SBCS)\n\nReturns:\n  0  - Success (code page set or unchanged)\n  -1 - Error (invalid code page and SBCS fallback disabled)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Code page 0: Forces single-byte character set mode via setSBCS\n  - Same code page: Early return with success, no reinitialization\n  - Predefined code pages: Uses cached data for 932, 936, 949, 950, 1361\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x04 - _M_LEADBYTE flag (marks lead bytes in DBCS)\n  0x08 - _M_VALIDCHAR flag (marks valid single-byte characters)\n  0x30 - Predefined code page entry size (48 bytes)\n  0x101 (257) - Size of _mbctype table (0x00-0xFF + 1 sentinel)\n\nGlobal Data Layout:\n  Offset    Size  Name                    Description\n  100153a0  0x101 g_abMbcType            Character type flags array\n  100154a4  4     g_dwCurrentCodePage    Active code page ID\n  100154a8  4     g_dwLocaleId           Locale ID from _CPtoLCID\n  100154b0  12    g_stMbCodePageInfo     Code page info structure\n  100154bc  4     g_fSbcsFallbackEnabled SBCS fallback flag\n  100154c0  8     g_abLeadByteTypeFlags  Lead byte type flags\n  100154c8  0xF0  g_astPredefinedCodePages Predefined CP table (5 entries)",
      "name_source": "Classic/1.00",
